**/.venv-1/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/ENV/

# venv internals — ONLY inside a venv folder
**/.venv/**/site-packages/
**/.venv/**/Scripts/
**/.venv/**/Lib/
**/.venv-1/**/site-packages/
**/.venv-1/**/Scripts/
**/.venv-1/**/Lib/
**/venv/**/site-packages/
**/venv/**/Scripts/
**/venv/**/Lib/
**/pyvenv.cfg

# ============================================================
# markowitz-stage: track docs/code, ignore only its venv/caches
# ============================================================
**/markowitz-stage/.venv/
**/markowitz-stage/.venv-1/
**/markowitz-stage/venv/
**/markowitz-stage/.pytest_cache/
**/markowitz-stage/.kilo/
**/markowitz-stage/.vscode/
**/markowitz-stage/__pycache__/
**/markowitz-stage/**/__pycache__/

